. *** 2. Panel structure ----------------------------------------------------------
. isid Code_Prov Year                      // one row per province-year

. ** province names as value labels of the numeric id
. qui levelsof Code_Prov, local(codes)

. foreach c of local codes {
  2.         qui levelsof Prov if Code_Prov == `c', local(nm)
  3.         label define prov_lbl `c' `nm', add
  4. }

. label values Code_Prov prov_lbl

. xtset Code_Prov Year

Panel variable: Code_Prov (strongly balanced)
 Time variable: Year, 2017 to 2025
         Delta: 1 unit

. xtdescribe

